{"v":3,"catch":"MEGA ZONE！深入未知的危機...","desc":"《Arcade Archives MEGA ZONE》是KONAMI於1984年推出的射擊遊戲。\n駕駛你的坦克直搗敵軍基地，目標是摧毀深藏於基地最深處的核心裝置。\n透過收集道具，兩輛坦克可合體強化。為迎戰未知敵人，務必積蓄足夠戰力！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請欣賞成就一代電子遊戲的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2026-02-12","genres":["街機","射擊"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"保護級","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/25525b5aae87e5c602375ba04ae1b7033c8c158d25e544de13c27c26af618ec0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2c029804fc32b871b40f83d1742a94b73f5852fb250c5c6539b04f24958e5a8b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/865452553d84c1649bab783fee2bded408ccf78de7f9d9637ff717b13de3eddd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/955c85c75ea2f202e6967ffb546b2c0de93a93e075c77a808de0051f67541f80.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8d557b6681353b15475bbfce6114956a7eb864afc26efc7b7ee9a16588468ee7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/83c23e1599a659665b3855a37b0a8edc3ed38be7e797a7f2931e35019a1f5a40.jpg"],"titleId":"01001e60269da000","dlc":[]}